<section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div><div style="margin-bottom:22px"><img src="{{ asset('images/profile-pic.png') }}" alt="Ronalyn Tolosa professional tech portrait" width="92" height="92" loading="eager" decoding="async" style="width:92px;height:92px;display:block;object-fit:cover;object-position:center;border:4px solid #fff;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 8px 24px #1b3a6a1a"></div><div class="eyebrow">Web app automation for modern operators</div><h1>Turning Manual Tasks into <span>Hands-Free Workflows.</span></h1><p>Hi, I'm Ronalyn. I build smart web app automations that help businesses eliminate repetitive tech tasks, reduce operational costs, and save hundreds of hours of manual labor.</p><div class="actions"><a class="primary" href="#work">View My Automation Projects →</a><a class="secondary" href="#contact">Let's Talk Business</a></div><p class="note">For international founders, teams, and businesses ready to make operations more efficient.</p></div><div class="card"><label>Automation outcome</label><h2 style="color:#1a1a1a">From trigger to completed task—without the busywork.</h2><div class="flow"><div style="color:#1a1a1a"><b>1</b>Customer completes an action</div><div style="color:#1a1a1a"><b>2</b>Apps sync data automatically</div><div style="color:#1a1a1a"><b>3</b>Fulfillment happens in real time</div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="services"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">What I do</div><h2>Web App Automation &amp; Deployment</h2><p class="intro">I connect the tools your business already uses and turn scattered manual steps into reliable, repeatable systems.</p><div class="service-grid"><div class="panel"><h3>Build the system. Ship the result.</h3><p>Every project is designed around a measurable operational win: fewer handoffs, faster delivery, cleaner data, and more capacity for high-value work.</p><ul><li>End-to-End Workflow Automation (Google Stitch, Webhooks)</li><li>Cloud Server Staging &amp; Live Deployment (Hostinger)</li><li>Version Control &amp; Repository Management (GitHub)</li><li>AI-Assisted Scripting &amp; Prompt Engineering (OpenAI Codex, ChatGPT)</li></ul></div><div class="proofs"><div class="proof"><strong>1–3 min</strong><span>Digital product delivery after purchase</span></div><div class="proof"><strong>24/7</strong><span>Hands-free storefront operation</span></div><div class="proof"><strong>100%</strong><span>Real-time customer data syncing</span></div><div class="proof"><strong>Less</strong><span>Repetitive operational work</span></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section projects" id="work"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Completed projects</div><h2>Automation built to work in the real world.</h2><p class="intro">A focused selection of operational web applications and automated systems—not placeholders or concept screens.</p><div class="grid3"><article class="project"><img src="{{ asset('images/educational-product-promo-gurogrid.png') }}" alt="GuroGrid digital product workflow"><div class="project-body"><div class="tag">Automated digital commerce</div><h3>GuroGrid</h3><p>Engineered an end-to-end automated workflow using Google Stitch and Hostinger, reducing digital product delivery time to 1–3 minutes post-purchase, creating a 100% hands-free 24/7 storefront with real-time customer data syncing.</p><span class="status">Live operational system</span></div></article><article class="project"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506744038136-46273834b3fb?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1400&amp;q=85" alt="ResortFlow hospitality application"><div class="project-body"><div class="tag">Hospitality operations</div><h3>ResortFlow</h3><p>A fully operational resort booking and guest management web application built via OpenAI Codex, version-controlled on GitHub, and deployed on live staging servers for practical testing and iteration.</p><span class="status">Live staging application</span></div></article><article class="project"><img src="{{ asset('images/driveflow-thumbnail.png') }}" alt="DriveFlow car rental application"><div class="project-body"><div class="tag">Fleet operations</div><h3>DriveFlow</h3><p>A fully operational car rental reservation and fleet management web application built via OpenAI Codex, version-controlled on GitHub, and deployed on live staging servers.</p><span class="status">Live staging application</span></div></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="process"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">How I work</div><h2>Clarity first. Automation second.</h2><p class="intro">A practical process that keeps technical work tied to business outcomes.</p><div class="process"><article><div class="tag">01 / Diagnose</div><h3>Map the friction</h3><p>Find the repetitive tasks, handoffs, and data gaps costing your team time.</p></article><article><div class="tag">02 / Design</div><h3>Plan the workflow</h3><p>Define triggers, tools, logic, and the simplest reliable path to the outcome.</p></article><article><div class="tag">03 / Build</div><h3>Develop the system</h3><p>Build, test, and document the automation with version-controlled code.</p></article><article><div class="tag">04 / Deploy</div><h3>Make it live</h3><p>Stage, launch, and refine the workflow so it keeps working as you grow.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section about" id="about"><div class="wrap about-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">About Ronalyn</div><h2>Technical thinking for smoother operations.</h2><p>I’m a tech-savvy problem solver who enjoys turning messy processes into clear, dependable systems. My strength is connecting the logic between people, tools, and business operations—then building the workflow that removes unnecessary effort.</p><p>I work best with teams that value practical solutions, clean communication, and measurable improvement. Whether the goal is faster fulfillment, better data flow, or less repetitive admin, I focus on building technology that earns its place in the business.</p></div><div><div class="eyebrow">Tech stack</div><div class="stack"><div>Google Stitch<small>Workflow automation</small></div><div>GitHub<small>Version control &amp; repositories</small></div><div>Hostinger Deployment<small>Cloud staging &amp; launch</small></div><div>OpenAI Codex<small>AI-assisted scripting</small></div><div>ChatGPT Workflows<small>Prompt-led operations</small></div><div>Canva<small>Interface assets only</small></div></div></div></div></section>
